module Core

### Represents the protocol for display-oriented textual output.
### `Representable` is for values that can produce a user-facing text form
### suitable for formatting, interpolation, and normal display APIs.
protocol Representable
  ### Returns the textual representation of this value.
  ### This is the default form used by formatting and display-oriented APIs and
  ### should prefer clarity over implementation detail.
  ### :returns: A human-readable text representation of this value.
  @[readonly, generated]
  routine Me.represent() -> Text
